	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nec nunc etiam haberem nuncium certum, per quem ad vos <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scriberem, nisi mercatores nostri Certiacum proficiscerentur; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>illis autem has trado, ut aut inde vel ex itinere ad vos eas mittant.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName>Brunnerus</persName> vero postremas tuas mihi attulit, et quod ip<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sum concernit, nihil hic egit; aderat enim tempore <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>valde importuno.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Morae autem impatiens (nam toto triduo non <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>potuit admitti ad senatum, licet illum singulariter <persName ref="p8063">Steigero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et Gravenrieto commendassem) constituit ad tempus aliquod <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l28">Basilaeam</placeName> proficisci et reversis ex <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudia</placeName> nostris lega<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tis redire.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Agebatur enim iis diebus de restitutione <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>illa Sabaudica, et aderant Helvetiorum legati; praeterea <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>agebantur alia, ut is non audiretur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Interea nostri cum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>legatis <placeName>4 Cantonum</placeName> in <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudiam</placeName> profecti sunt, ut re<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>stituant duci praefecturas illas, quas scis, quod deus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>bene vertat!</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Von <placeName ref="l300">Lucern</placeName> ist bott <persName>schultheß Pfiffer</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>von <placeName>Schwytz</placeName> amman <placeName>Reding</placeName>, von <placeName ref="l646">Glaris</placeName> <persName>amman Schuͦler</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>von <placeName>Basel</placeName> <persName>burgermeister Kruͦg</persName>, von hinnen <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>her <persName ref="p8063">schultheß Steiger</persName>, beed seckelmeister, <persName>Gravenriet</persName> und <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName>Manuel</persName>, her <persName>von Mülinen</persName>, <persName>Benedict von Dießbach</persName> und <persName>Hans Jacob Delsperger</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Prioribus diebus etiam actum e<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>st de <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>foedere <placeName ref="l832">Gallico</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Quid conclusum sit, ex prioribus meis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>audivisti;</foreign> ist nitt gar, sonder allein diser zyt abgschlagen; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ich sorg aber, es werd kein nachlaßen sin, und sind vil der <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>besten under minen herren darhinder kon, das si meinend, es <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sige gar nitt ußgeschlon.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Opponimus nos, quantum possumus; hinc <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>magna nobis odia conciliamus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Quod <placeName>Angusolam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>attinet, de quo scribis, non est hic et paucis diebus hic fuit, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>neque nostri passi fuissent eum diutius hic haerere.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed <placeName ref="l922">Fribur<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>gi</placeName> egit aliquamdiu; quid illic egerit, nescio, neque eti<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>am, an adhuc illic sit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quae de legato vestro ad <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>misso scribis, et quid inde attulerit, secretioribus tantum communicavi; <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sed hoc idem iisdem diebus <placeName ref="l555">Vitoduro</placeName> huc ad quendam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>civium nostrorum scriptum est, qui hac re totam urbem <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>implesset, nisi illum compescuissem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Adeo apud nos/vos <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>video, non secretum esse hoc negotium.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nostri vero nihil <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>sibi timent ab his consiliis, quę contra Helvetios communi<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ter instituuntur, et favent <placeName ref="l850">Austriacis</placeName> partibus sicut etiam <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>vos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Sonst anderer dingen halb weiß ich nüt; es ist bi <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>uns gar still.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l875">Hispanier</placeName> sond in das <placeName ref="l20">Niderland</placeName> hinab <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>und hin und wider in die besatzungen zerteilt sin.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Die <lb xml:id="p1z43"/><placeName ref="l862">Eidgnossen</placeName> sond uff das <placeName ref="l2589">Picardy</placeName> zuͦziehen, die grentzen zuͦ be<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>waren.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Uß <placeName ref="l822">Tütschland</placeName> habend wir nüt.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Expecto, quid <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>tu habeas.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te <persName ref="p7449">Diesbachius</persName>, qui absente consule <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>nunc rebus praeest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Consuli tuas obtuli et vidi munus, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>quod illi misisti; agit tibi gratias et aget per literas <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>etiam proprias, cum fuerit reversus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>dic meo nomine tuis omnibus.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 28. augusti 1567.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[o<lb xml:id="p1z50"/>hannes] <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>charissimo et colendissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>meo domino et compatri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
